/P 309 0 R
/E (Copyright for an open access work depends on the license selected and any associated publishing agreements. In general, you maintain copyright over the work and select an open license allowing others to reuse/remix it. However, publishing agreements may involve turning your copyright over to the publisher and allowing them to choose the open license. You can visit the U of I Copyright Guide to learn about open licenses and managing your author rights.)
/Pg 15 0 R
