endobj
155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 316 0 R
/E (In traditional academic publishing, editorial, production, and hosting costs are covered by subscription fees. To make articles open access, some publishers shift these costs from the reader onto the author in the form of article processing charges \(APCs\). Charging APCs for accepted articles does not automatically make a journal predatory. However, be wary of publishers that expect payment at the time of submission.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
